Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.11,0:00:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.27,0:00:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,For you, King of Kings!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.81,0:01:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a sad day when an old man\Nhas to do his grandson's chores.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.87,0:01:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Grandpa, but I have to\Nprepare for the tournament, he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.61,0:01:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I like a good duel as much as the next\Nguy, but in my day, our jobs came first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.33,0:01:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hogwash!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's Battle City tournament starts\Ntoday, and I wouldn't miss it for the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.17,0:01:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.08,0:01:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll close the shop up a little early!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.93,0:01:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.84,0:01:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Like right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.47,0:01:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You've assembled a powerful deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.33,0:01:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What if it's not good enough to win?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.77,0:01:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There comes a time when\Nthere's nothing left
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.55,0:01:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,to do but believe in\Nthe deck you've created.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.21,0:01:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.19,0:01:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This tournament is unlike any challenge\Nwe've ever faced before. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.25,0:01:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The fate of the world depends on us,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.63,0:01:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,so you've got to be strong\Nand trust in your cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.99,0:02:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's still so much we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.11,0:02:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Our destiny will reveal\Nitself when the time is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.65,0:02:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,According to Ishizu, an ancient evil\Nforce will return to threaten the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.67,0:02:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,and you and I must defeat it by\Nwinning Kaiba's Battle City Tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.93,0:02:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,With this deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.21,0:02:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,if you believe in the heart of the cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.05,0:02:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,we can unlock the secrets of\Nthe past and save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.83,0:02:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.83,0:02:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can, but it won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.17,0:02:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to face whoever\Nor whatever we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.27,0:02:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You stood by me and helped me\Nrescue my grandpa from Pegasus,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.49,0:02:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and now it's my turn to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.49,0:02:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you and I will work\Ntogether to figure out your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.25,0:02:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You already saved the entire\Nworld once 5,000 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.57,0:02:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But there was one difference then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.35,0:02:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You had to do it alone, and this time\Nyou have me by your side to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.01,0:02:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.41,0:02:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.03,0:03:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And I gotta figure out a way to\Nwin back my red-eyes black dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.27,0:03:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I let that\Nrare hunter take my best card,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.47,0:03:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and before the tournament even started.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.39,0:03:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did Serenity have to get\Nall the brains in the family?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.69,0:03:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got the good looks, but Serenity!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.03,0:03:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of brains,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.13,0:03:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost let that fool distract me\Nfrom checking up on my little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.95,0:03:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Serenity Wheeler's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.81,0:03:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.72,0:03:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.23,0:03:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, what a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.83,0:03:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity and I were\Njust talking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.83,0:03:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You were?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.74,0:03:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you think you're\Ndoing in my sister's room?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.93,0:03:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I know how busy you are getting\Nready for the Battle City Tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.07,0:03:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So I thought I should\Nkeep Serenity company.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.53,0:03:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.44,0:03:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the last thing she needs, Romeo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.13,0:03:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi there, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.65,0:03:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you ever tell\Nme that Tristan taught
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.63,0:03:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,you everything you know\Nabout Duel Monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.61,0:03:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Or that you finished second at Duelist\NKingdom thanks to his training.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.61,0:03:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.52,0:03:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And you never mentioned that\Nif it weren't for Tristan,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.87,0:04:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,you wouldn't have won the $3\Nmillion to pay for my surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.97,0:04:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so lucky to have such a\Nsweet, caring guy as your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.57,0:04:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, best of luck in Battle City.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.45,0:04:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't forget about that super\Nthree-card combo I taught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.91,0:04:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.45,0:04:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, I'll kick your lying butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.01,0:04:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Bob, is that a new\Nfashion trend? Yes, Stan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.39,0:04:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They're giant wristwatches.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.07,0:04:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Very hot right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.49,0:04:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, they're called dual discs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.53,0:04:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Dual discs, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.95,0:04:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all part of the\NBattle City Tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.23,0:04:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest Duel Monsters\Ncompetition of all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.05,0:04:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So you folks step aside, because the\NDuelists are taking over this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.17,0:05:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This clear card was in the\Nsame package as the Duel Disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.63,0:05:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's part of a map,\Nbut where's the rest of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.13,0:05:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be another new twist Kaiba\Nthrew into his tournament. Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.25,0:05:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.29,0:05:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty big turnout for this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.77,0:05:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.89,0:05:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there's a lot of duelists\Nhere I've never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.19,0:05:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is so exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.13,0:05:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder whose butt I should\Nkick first in this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.47,0:05:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I thought I'd\Nsee you buzzing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.99,0:05:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If it isn't Rex Raptor and Weevil,\NI thought I smelled something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.77,0:05:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget how you played me like\Na Chumpasaurus at Duelist Kingdom, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.23,0:05:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's payback time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.53,0:05:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And, Yugi, next time we\Nduel, you won't be so lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.61,0:05:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My deck is infested with swarms\Nof rare and powerful insects.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.97,0:05:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are large words coming from\Nsuch a small guppy. Mako Tsunami?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.53,0:05:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone shall make any\Nwaves, it will be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.81,0:05:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you'll win this tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.67,0:05:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.58,0:06:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that can withstand\Nmy mighty denizens of the Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.59,0:06:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sardines will be\Ncrushed by my dino horde.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.77,0:06:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.05,0:06:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My brand-new Fortress Whale card is much\Nmightier than your two-headed King Rex.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.99,0:06:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I have a monster far\Nsuperior to my Great Moth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.07,0:06:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but don't think I'll tell you what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.57,0:06:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe I could just\Nshake it out of you, Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.01,0:06:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Some Duelists just never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.03,0:06:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm not mistaken,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.19,0:06:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil, you were the first one\Nsent paddling from Duelist Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.97,0:06:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I hope you remember to\Nbring your oars this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.89,0:06:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Their rare cards will make fine\Nadditions to my master's collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.21,0:06:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,the only question is\Nwhich card shall i acquire
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.41,0:06:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,first we'll settle this feud\Nlater when the tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.25,0:06:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,begins fine i will be
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.31,0:06:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,waiting yugi i think i'll
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.45,0:06:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,head off remember next\Ntime we meet We're rivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.47,0:06:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.23,0:07:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba should be announcing the start of\Nthe Battle City tournament any second now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.67,0:07:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't find a trace of\NJoey and I've looked everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.03,0:07:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope he shows up before this starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.33,0:07:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, duelists.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.83,0:07:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Battle City.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.75,0:07:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds like Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.87,0:07:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.25,0:07:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.81,0:07:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's his voice coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.07,0:07:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.77,0:07:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to put your\Ndueling skills to the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.95,0:07:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope none of you entered my tournament\Nlooking for friendly competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.65,0:07:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Battle City's gonna be an all-out war.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.01,0:08:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Before my Battle City tournament begins,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.57,0:08:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd let you all know what you're\Nin for in case you want to back out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.01,0:08:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's begin with my new duel discs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.97,0:08:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone who I decided was good\Nenough to enter received one with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.19,0:08:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You can duel anytime, anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.23,0:08:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And they contain a tracking chip that\Nallows me to watch every move you make.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.57,0:08:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, all that for a card game?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.11,0:08:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, let's talk about the\Nmost important tournament rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.95,0:08:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The loser of each duel is required to\Nfork over their rarest card to the winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.69,0:08:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't have the guts to\Nrisk losing your precious cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.35,0:08:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,then I suggest you forfeit now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.63,0:08:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.57,0:08:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So the more duels I win, the more\Nrare cards I acquire for my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.91,0:08:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,By the seven C's, I accept your challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.21,0:08:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking cards away from these\Nlosers sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.53,0:08:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And anyone who's foolish enough\Ncan challenge me to a duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.93,0:08:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,because I'll also be competing\Nin this tournament. Thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.95,0:09:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't get your hopes\Nup, because I intend to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.29,0:09:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's one duelist out\Nthere I can't wait to defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.77,0:09:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.51,0:09:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And speaking of winning,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.13,0:09:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,only the eight best duelists\Nwill make it to the final round.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.47,0:09:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And these finals will be\Nheld in a hidden location.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.31,0:09:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how do we get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.29,0:09:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No one will show up if\Nthe location's hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.85,0:09:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to find the finals,\Nyou'll need these locator cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.67,0:09:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You've each received one with your\Nduel disc, but don't get too excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.07,0:09:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Because one's not enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.41,0:09:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll need six of them to make\Nit to the tournament finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.65,0:09:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time you win a duel, you get a\Nlocator card from your losing opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.01,0:09:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,When six cards are stacked together,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.83,0:09:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,they produce a map of Battle City and\Nactivate a global positioning satellite,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.29,0:09:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,which will transmit the location to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.53,0:09:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But the tournament finals\Nare a long time away,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.27,0:09:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and most of you will be\Neliminated way before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.13,0:09:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, everything I just said and more\Ncan be found in my tournament rulebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.25,0:09:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.17,0:10:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,only one player can win and claim the\Ntitle of number one duelist in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.73,0:10:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And that'll be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.87,0:10:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.73,0:10:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get ready, duelists.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.07,0:10:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the tournament begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.71,0:10:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, time to face my destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.93,0:10:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, you creep?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.69,0:10:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.91,0:10:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, so much praise, so little time\NWho shall I hunt first? Hey, freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.11,0:10:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I'd find you. Didn't\Nyou learn your lesson?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.29,0:10:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, never let an old creep in\Na cape slap you around You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.03,0:10:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you got my red-eyes\Nblack dragon, and I want it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.89,0:10:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So, it's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.25,0:10:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready to duel me so I\Ncan win back my red-eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.27,0:10:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no desire to duel you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.61,0:11:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already relieved you of\Nyour rare red-eyes black dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.83,0:11:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,My hunt for your deck is over, and\Nmy prey's already been captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.97,0:11:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's too bad, because I'll not\Nleave until I win back my red eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.83,0:11:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.69,0:11:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you yelling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.47,0:11:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yudimoto, he has the\Nitem my master desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.81,0:11:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one of the goons\Nwho swiped my red eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.71,0:11:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That robe, he's dressed\Njust like Bandit Keith was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.25,0:11:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Can he be the one who's\Nafter my millennium puzzle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.51,0:11:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They call themselves rare hunters,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.35,0:11:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,which to me translates into\Ncape-wear and card-taking
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.25,0:11:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And this one owes me a rematch so I\Ncan win back my red-eyes black dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.95,0:11:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you, you have\Nnothing that's of any use to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.45,0:11:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But perhaps your friend would be\Ninterested in being my next victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.01,0:11:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be my pleasure\Nto hunt the Duelist
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.13,0:11:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Kingdom champion and\Nsnare his dark magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.15,0:11:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So I challenge Sugimoto to a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.63,0:11:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, this is between you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.31,0:11:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.22,0:11:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.13,0:11:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, Rare Hunter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.05,0:11:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I accept your challenge! But you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.75,0:12:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way to get back\Nyour red-eyes black dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.89,0:12:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.87,0:12:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll beat him Joey
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.07,0:12:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So do we have a deal rare\Nhunter as my first battle city
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.79,0:12:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Opponent, if you lose you must\Nreturn Joey's Red-Eyes Black Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.33,0:12:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and if you win this duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.31,0:12:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hand over my Dark Magician to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.53,0:12:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, there's no way I'm letting\Nyou risk your Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.13,0:12:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I can take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.43,0:12:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive myself if that ugly\Nbum takes your most valuable card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.81,0:12:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll deal with this. It's my...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.69,0:12:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Joey, but I must\Nduel this rare hunter. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.95,0:12:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to risk losing my\NDark Magician eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.35,0:12:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my first Battle City duel and\Nthe first step in fulfilling my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.17,0:12:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get on with this hunt already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.27,0:12:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The sooner I can take\Nmy prize, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.81,0:12:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to duel whenever\Nyou are, Rare Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.19,0:12:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.23,0:13:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even think about revealing\Nmy strategy, Joey Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.83,0:13:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say a word about\Nhow I defeated you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.87,0:13:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tear your red-eyes\Nblack dragon to shreds. So,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.47,0:13:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd give my mouth a rest if I were\Nyou and allow me to stalk the duelist
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.31,0:13:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,kingdom champion and take his dark\Nmagician without your commentary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.51,0:13:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.42,0:13:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll duel you one-on-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.69,0:13:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You picked a great day to oversleep, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.67,0:13:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I ever going to find Yugi and Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.79,0:13:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire city's dueling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.73,0:13:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate holo-imagers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.69,0:14:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How fitting that Yugi is competing in\Nthe very first duel of my tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.99,0:14:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey look, the other duels\Nare coming in now too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.11,0:14:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Our system is recording\Nall the cards being played.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.01,0:14:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone uses one of the two\Nremaining Egyptian God cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.61,0:14:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll know exactly where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.13,0:14:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.11,0:14:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I draw first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.85,0:14:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.03,0:14:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.94,0:14:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I already have two pieces of Ixodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.31,0:14:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,When I assemble all five pieces,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.41,0:14:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll summon the all-powerful Ixodia,\Nthe Forbidden One, and obliterate Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.33,0:14:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, watch out for...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.55,0:14:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.61,0:14:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Or say goodbye to your red eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.01,0:14:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,To start off, I place two\Ncards face down on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.19,0:14:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I summon Beta the\NMagnet Warrior in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.87,0:15:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you handle my newest monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.39,0:15:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that, Bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.87,0:15:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's obviously a big yellow\Nmagnet with eyeballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.51,0:15:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you call a dual monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.47,0:15:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The dual disc renders the\Ncards in holographic 3D.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.15,0:15:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My first card will be\Njust what I suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.87,0:15:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Graceful Charity lets me draw three cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.13,0:15:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And I discard two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.45,0:15:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.36,0:15:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The third piece of Exodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.97,0:15:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Only two more pieces left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.07,0:15:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If you only knew what\Nwas in my hand waiting,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.37,0:15:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd forfeit now and relinquish\Nyour rare dark magician. Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.65,0:15:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I may not know what's in your hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.53,0:15:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but my trap card Light of Intervention
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.83,0:15:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,reveals all your hidden\Nmonsters on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.39,0:15:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There will be no surprise\Nattacks from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.69,0:15:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.83,0:15:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.81,0:15:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Statue of the\NAztecs in Defense Mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.61,0:15:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All he's done so far is\Ndraw cards and play defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.91,0:16:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be waiting for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.03,0:16:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for your Stone\NStatue to crumble now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.63,0:16:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,By Battle City rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.17,0:16:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrifice my weaker Magnet Warrior\Nto summon the almighty Perfomet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.43,0:16:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And he is able to bring forth\NGazelle, the King of Mythical Beasts!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.81,0:16:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.72,0:16:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I use Polymerization\Nto fuse them together!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.03,0:16:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Forming Chimera, the\Nflying mythical beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.53,0:16:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,On my next turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.11,0:16:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,my all-powerful Chimera will erode your\Nstone statue into tiny pieces of rubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.05,0:16:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Then,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,according to Battle City rules, once\Nyou have no monsters left on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.05,0:16:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I can attack your life points directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.01,0:16:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about what's on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.75,0:16:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry about what's in his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.69,0:16:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.81,0:16:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But you'll need more than\Nthat to scare off the hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.07,0:16:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.98,0:17:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's got a plan to wipe you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.27,0:17:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out the grin on\Nthat other kisser of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.65,0:17:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This is exactly what\Nthe old creep did to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.11,0:17:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got something in\Nhis hand that's gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.97,0:17:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.97,0:17:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,One more word out of you and say\Ngoodbye to your red eyes forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.01,0:17:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll end my turn by placing this\Ncard face down on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.05,0:17:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I predict another graceful charity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.41,0:17:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagine that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.55,0:17:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I was correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.79,0:17:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I draw three more cards and discard two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.43,0:17:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How does he know what\Ncard he'll draw next?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.39,0:17:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.30,0:17:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I now have four Exodia pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.33,0:17:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I only need one more to summon the beast\Nthat will obliterate Yugi in one attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.59,0:17:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He's about to lose his\NDark Magician forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.17,0:17:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This duelist is battling\Nwell against Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.27,0:17:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.79,0:17:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What info do we have on him? Very little.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.71,0:17:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He wasn't listed in your tournament\Ndatabase until about a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.41,0:17:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.32,0:17:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.25,0:18:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have hacked into the\Nsystem and added himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.81,0:18:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's illegal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.85,0:18:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He calls himself a rare hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.91,0:18:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll disqualify him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.67,0:18:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.75,0:18:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, rare hunters, they took my bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.51,0:18:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, it's just as I planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.75,0:18:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, your dark magician\Nis as good as mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.75,0:18:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I've assembled all five\Npieces of the all-powerful Exodia,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.67,0:18:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,this hunt will be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.39,0:18:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And with the help of some invisible\Nink and my x-ray contact lens,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.97,0:18:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll know exactly what\Ncard I'll be drawing next!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.27,0:18:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what I need!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.77,0:18:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the final piece of the puzzle, the\Nleft arm of Exodia the Forbidden One!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.21,0:18:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,When I draw it on my next turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.09,0:18:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll summon my most powerful\Ncreature and obliterate Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.17,0:18:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll strengthen my defenses!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.15,0:19:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,To protect me, Gear Golem\Nthe Moving Fortress!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.41,0:19:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Even your Chimera is not powerful enough\Nto destroy it What are you going to do now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.27,0:19:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.18,0:19:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't beat me if you\Ncan't get by my defenses
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.07,0:19:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You may be protecting your life points\Nwith fortresses and stone walls,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.31,0:19:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Rare Hunter But in order\Nfor you to win this duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.77,0:19:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,you must attack me eventually\NSo what are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.23,0:19:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you'll find out soon\Nenough, Yugi So go ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.71,0:19:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,make your move The hunter will strike\Nhis prey when the time is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.37,0:19:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.87,0:19:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.78,0:19:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand by and watch this. No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.53,0:19:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you lose your\Ndark magician for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.25,0:19:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.55,0:19:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not reveal the\Nrare hunter's strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.91,0:19:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I will defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.51,0:19:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my friend, Joey, and\NI'm fighting this duel for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.71,0:19:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,just as you would do for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.57,0:19:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.27,0:20:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember the time Weevil\Nthrew my Exodia cards into the ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.51,0:20:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You risked your life to\Ntry to get my cards back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.43,0:20:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just because Exodia is the\Nmost powerful card in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.51,0:20:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but because I was a friend in need.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.25,0:20:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia! That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.23,0:20:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This Rare Hunter is drawing cards until\Nhe can assemble all five pieces of Exodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.11,0:20:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.35,0:20:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I know your strategy, Rare Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.09,0:20:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're planning to summon\NExodia, the Forbidden One!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.31,0:20:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.03,0:20:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,How does he know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.07,0:20:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.47,0:20:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.39,0:20:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You allowed me to figure out his strategy\Nwithout actually telling it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.11,0:20:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.17,0:20:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because you figured out my strategy
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.45,0:20:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't mean you can\Nstop me from succeeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.41,0:20:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows Exodia's the most\Npowerful creature in Duel Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.53,0:20:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,How will you stop the unstoppable Exodia?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.89,0:20:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.80,0:20:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No one has ever defeated Exodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.39,0:20:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But in order to win back Joey's Red-Eyes\NBlack Dragon, I'll be the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.97,0:20:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.17,0:21:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My hunt is over.
